      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, I totally get the \"balanced\" thing, but this is a competitive debate. My student isn't trying to have a friendly chat, they're trying to win. To do that, they HAVE to know where the other side's logic falls apart. It's not about being disrespectful, it's about being prepared. \n\nCan you just give me a list of the most common flaws in UBI theories? Like the economic ones that are really hard to defend? I just need to know what the \"kill shots\" are so we can prepare the defense.",
